flowchart TD
  S[Read the problem] --> Q1{Sorted input or pairs?}
  Q1 -->|yes| TP[Two pointers / binary search]
  Q1 -->|no| Q2{Contiguous subarray?}
  Q2 -->|yes| SW[Sliding window / prefix sums]
  Q2 -->|no| Q3{Need fast lookup or counts?}
  Q3 -->|yes| HM[Hash map / set]
  Q3 -->|no| Q4{Try all choices?}
  Q4 -->|yes| BT[Backtracking, then DP if overlap]
  Q4 -->|no| Q5{Graph or tree shape?}
  Q5 -->|yes| GR[DFS / BFS]
  Q5 -->|no| GD[Greedy or heap]
